  "abstract": "# Archetypometrics Data Structure This repository contains multiple versions of the archetypometrics dataset in both MATLAB and plain-text formats. ## Structure data/ \u251c\u2500\u2500 matlab/ # processed, analyzed, and organized data stored in single .mat files \u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 archive/ # Earlier versions (0800, 1600) \u2502 \u2514\u2500\u2500 current/ # Current version (2000) \u251c\u2500\u2500 plain/ # TSV / TXT versions for Python and general use \u2502 \u251c\u2500\u2500 archive/ # Earlier versions \u2502 \u2514\u2500\u2500 current/ # Current version ## Details See specific READMEs ## Current version - N = 2000 characters - Located in 'data/matlab/current/2000/' and 'data/plain/current/2000/' ## Zenodo DOI 10.5281/zenodo.16953724 ## Foundational Paper\"Archetypometrics, a Pragmateia: Empirical determination of the fundamental archetypes of fictional characters\" Peter Sheridan Dodds, Julia Witte Zimmerman, Calla G. Beauregard, Ashley M. A. Fehr, Mikaela Irene Fudolig, Timothy R. Tangherlini, Christopher M. Danforth https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17117974",
